# MassLogic Brand Assets

This directory contains official, approved visual assets for the MassLogic ecosystem. Use of these assets is subject to the [MassLogic Brand Guidelines v1.1](https://github.com/MassLogic/.github/blob/main/BRANDING.md).

Current assets are provided in high-resolution PNG format with transparency. For large-scale print or high-fidelity web applications requiring vector files, please contact brand@masslogic.io.

### 🚫 Usage Restrictions
- **No Alterations**: Do not rotate, skew, or apply shadows/gradients to any logo.
- **Clear Space**: Maintain sufficient clear space around all marks[cite: 1].
- **Approved Files Only**: Do not recreate or redraw any MassLogic logo[cite: 1].

### 📧 Support & Approvals
All co-branded materials must be reviewed and approved prior to publication[cite: 1]. 
- **Brand Approvals**: brand@masslogic.io
- **Partnerships**: partnerships@masslogic.io
